SMTP gateway Python

The SMTP gateway implementation was extracted from qbox/gstack:
https://github.com/qbox/gstack/tree/0c0d1dde2d8c7a7b743e1b02ae6d12b9edc1e2f6/plugins/packages/gstack-smtp-gateway

The extracted implementation is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Its source history is retained in this repository.

The server implementation is maintained in packages/smtp-gateway-server/.
The management client and shared HTTP schemas are maintained in packages/smtp-gateway-client/.
